Subject: [PATCH] exception: include string.h for strlen/strncmp prototypes

Implicit declarations are treated as errors with current toolchains.
Add the missing header to provide prototypes for strlen/strncmp.

---
 include/exception.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/exception.h b/include/exception.h
index 9d9c68e98b..e8a0f2e2b7 100644
--- a/include/exception.h
+++ b/include/exception.h
@@
 #ifndef __EXCEPTION_H
 #define __EXCEPTION_H
 
+#include <string.h>
 #include <errno.h>
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_CMD_EXCEPTION
 void exception_init(void);
